вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"This jacket costs £80. (Сколько стоит?)","a":["How much does this jacket cost?","How much is this jacket?","How much does it cost?","How much is it?"],"ex":"How much + does + it + cost?","p":"Задайте вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"He is 35. (Сколько лет?)","a":["How old is he?"],"ex":"Возраст → How old is he?","p":"Задайте вопрос"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку и соберите","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"Where you work?","w":1,"c":"do you","ex":"Нужен do: Where do you work?"},{"t":"fix","q":"Do you interested in history?","w":0,"c":"Are","ex":"interested — to be: Are you interested…?"},{"t":"fix","q":"What time does the shop opens?","w":5,"c":"open","ex":"После does — open."},{"t":"order","w":["listen","you","do","to","music","what"],"a":["What music do you listen to?"],"ex":"What music + do + you + listen + to?"},{"t":"order","w":["times","a","how","does","she","many","week","run"],"a":["How many times a week does she run?"],"ex":"How many times a week + does + she + run?"}]}]},{"id":"big","nav":"Итоговая","eyebrow":"Итоговая контрольная · весь курс","title":"Большая итоговая работа","theory":"<p>Задания по <b>всем урокам</b> вперемешку. Это самая сложная проверка: нужно каждый раз самому понять, какая тема перед вами.</p>\n<p>Совет: перед ответом спросите себя: <b>есть ли в предложении глагол-действие?</b> Если нет — am / is / are. Если есть — do / does, -s или don't / doesn't.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"My flat ___ very big, but it's comfortable.","o":["isn't","doesn't","hasn't"],"a":"isn't","ex":"big — какой → isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"My flat ___ a balcony.","o":["isn't got","hasn't got","doesn't got"],"a":"hasn't got","ex":"have got: flat = it → hasn't got."},{"t":"choice","q":"My sister ___ in a café at the weekend.","o":["work","works","is work"],"a":"works","ex":"sister = she → works."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your children like school?","o":["Are","Do","Does"],"a":"Do","ex":"like — действие, children = they → Do."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your children at school now?","o":["Are","Do","Does"],"a":"Are","ex":"at school — где → Are."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ are these? — They're Jack's.","o":["Whose","Who's","Who"],"a":"Whose","ex":"Чьи → Whose."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is this your umbrella? — No, it isn't ___.","o":["my","mine","me"],"a":"mine","ex":"Без предмета → mine."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ a car, so we usually go by bus.","o":["don't have","haven't","aren't have"],"a":"don't have","ex":"don't have (или haven't got)."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ to work by bike every day.","o":["go","am go","goes"],"a":"go","ex":"I → go."},{"t":"choice","q":"He ___ TV in the morning.","o":["never watches","doesn't never watch","never watch"],"a":"never watches","ex":"never без doesn't, he → watches."},{"t":"choice","q":"Where … he from? — He's from Italy. He's … .","o":["is / Italian","does / Italian","is / Italy"],"a":"is / Italian","ex":"from → is; национальность → Italian."},{"t":"choice","q":"It ___ yesterday. Today it's sunny.","o":["rains","was rainy","is rainy"],"a":"was rainy","ex":"yesterday → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"I'm … in football, but my husband finds it … .","o":["interested / boring","interesting / bored","interested / bored"],"a":"interested / boring","ex":"Я — interested, футбол — boring."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Мне холодно.»","o":["I'm cold.","It is cold for me.","I have cold."],"a":"I'm cold.","ex":"Состояние — через to be."},{"t":"choice","q":"We meet … Saturday mornings … 10 o'clock.","o":["on / at","in / at","at / on"],"a":"on / at","ex":"on + день, at + время."},{"t":"choice","q":"Does Harry have any brothers? — No, he ___.","o":["hasn't","doesn't","isn't"],"a":"doesn't","ex":"Вопрос с Does → No, he doesn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"Has Harry got any brothers? — No, he ___.","o":["hasn't","doesn't","isn't"],"a":"hasn't","ex":"Вопрос с Has… got → No, he hasn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"… keys are on the table. Are they …?","o":["This / your","These / yours","These / your"],"a":"These / yours","ex":"keys → These; без предмета → yours."}]},{"title":"Часть B · переведите на английский","items":[{"t":"input","q":"«Мой брат не пьёт кофе.»","a":["My brother doesn't drink coffee.","My brother does not drink coffee."],"ex":"brother = he → doesn't drink.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Где работает твоя мама?»","a":["Where does your mum work?","Where does your mother work?","Where does your mom work?"],"ex":"Where + does + your mum + work?","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«У неё есть собака.»","a":["She has got a dog.","She's got a dog.","She has a dog."],"ex":"has got / has.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Это не мой телефон.»","a":["This isn't my phone.","This is not my phone.","It isn't my phone.","It is not my phone.","It's not my phone."],"ex":"is not + my phone.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Ты обычно встаёшь рано?»","a":["Do you usually get up early?"],"ex":"Do + you + usually + get up + early?","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Мы из России.»","a":["We are from Russia.","We're from Russia."],"ex":"We are from Russia.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"She have got three children.","w":1,"c":"has","ex":"she → has got."},{"t":"fix","q":"Does your husband likes cooking?","w":3,"c":"like","ex":"После Does — like."},{"t":"fix","q":"Whose is this book? It's Annas.","w":5,"c":"Anna's","ex":"Принадлежность → Anna's."},{"t":"fix","q":"They doesn't live here.","w":1,"c":"don't","ex":"they → don't."},{"t":"fix","q":"Are you work on Mondays?","w":0,"c":"Do","ex":"work — действие → Do you work…?"},{"t":"fix","q":"I'm usually go to bed at midnight.","w":0,"c":"I","ex":"go — действие, am лишний: I usually go to bed…"}]},{"title":"Часть D · соберите предложение","items":[{"t":"order","w":["does","time","finish","your","what","sister","work"],"a":["What time does your sister finish work?"],"ex":"What time + does + your sister + finish work?"},{"t":"order","w":["these","aren't","gloves","mine"],"a":["These gloves aren't mine."],"ex":"These gloves + aren't + mine."},{"t":"order","w":["got","house","country","my","parents","the","in","a","have"],"a":["My parents have got a house in the country."],"ex":"My parents + have got + a house + in the country."},{"t":"order","w":["I","at","the","hardly","ever","watch","TV","weekend"],"a":["I hardly ever watch TV at the weekend."],"ex":"I + hardly ever + watch TV + at the weekend."}]}]}]}$lesson$::jsonb)
